@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor black
  LifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
  ParticipantBorderColor #2196F3
  ParticipantFontColor #1565C0
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam noteBorderColor #F9A825

title ttt — refusals are ADDRESSED, resync is always available

participant "player X" as X
participant "server (the authority)" as S
participant "player O" as O

O -> S : MOVE 5
S --> O : REFUSED turn
note over S : not O's turn — the refusal goes to the\nasker ALONE; X hears nothing

X -> S : MOVE 5
S --> X : STATE 1234X6789
S --> O : STATE 1234X6789

O -> S : MOVE 5
S --> O : REFUSED taken

O -> S : STATE
S --> O : STATE 1234X6789
note over S : no clock anywhere — a confused client\nresyncs with STATE and plays on
@enduml
